# FloatChat Server Environment Configuration

# =============================================================================
# DATABASE CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://username:password@localhost:5432/db_name

# =============================================================================
# CHROMA VECTOR DATABASE
# =============================================================================
CHROMA_PERSIST_DIR=./chroma_data

# =============================================================================
# SERVER CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================
BACKEND_HOST=127.0.0.1
BACKEND_PORT=8000
FRONTEND_HOST=localhost
FRONTEND_PORT=3000

# =============================================================================
# GEMINI API CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================

# Your Gemini API key (required)
# Get one from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Gemini model to use (optional, defaults to gemini-2.0-flash)
# Choose from the models below based on your needs:
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# =============================================================================
# AVAILABLE GEMINI MODELS (as of September 2025)
# =============================================================================
# 
# TEXT-ONLY MODELS (Current default):
# - gemini-2.0-flash              : Fast, versatile, good for text responses
# - gemini-2.0-flash-lite         : Cost-efficient, low latency
# - gemini-2.5-flash              : Best price-performance with thinking
# - gemini-2.5-flash-lite         : Most cost-efficient with high throughput
# - gemini-2.5-pro                : Most powerful thinking model
# 
# IMAGE GENERATION MODELS (For creating images):
# - gemini-2.5-flash-image-preview     : NEW! Generate and edit images conversationally
# - gemini-2.0-flash-preview-image-generation  : Conversational image generation
# 
# MULTIMODAL MODELS (Can understand images, video, audio):
# - gemini-2.5-flash              : Input: audio, images, videos, text → Output: text
# - gemini-2.5-pro                : Input: audio, images, videos, text, PDF → Output: text
# - gemini-2.0-flash              : Input: audio, images, videos, text → Output: text
# 
# SPECIALIZED MODELS:
# - gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio     : Audio input/output with natural conversations
# - gemini-2.0-flash-live-001         : Real-time voice/video interactions
# - gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts      : Text-to-speech generation
# 
# =============================================================================
# RECOMMENDATIONS FOR IMAGE CAPABILITIES
# =============================================================================
# 
# For IMAGE GENERATION (creating new images):
# → Use: gemini-2.5-flash-image-preview
#   Features: Text-to-image, image editing, conversational refinement
#   Best for: Creating logos, diagrams, artwork, product mockups
# 
# For IMAGE UNDERSTANDING (analyzing existing images):
# → Use: gemini-2.5-flash or gemini-2.5-pro
#   Features: Can analyze, describe, and answer questions about images
#   Best for: Image analysis, OCR, visual question answering
# 
# For BOTH IMAGE GENERATION + UNDERSTANDING:
# → Use: gemini-2.5-flash-image-preview
#   This model can both create and understand images
# 
# =============================================================================
# IMPORTANT NOTES
# =============================================================================
# 
# 1. Model Availability: Some preview models may have limited availability
#    Check current status at: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models
# 
# 2. Image Generation: All generated images include SynthID watermarks
# 
# 3. Rate Limits: Different models have different rate limits and pricing
#    See: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits
# 
# 4. Cost Considerations:
#    - *-lite models are most cost-effective
#    - Image generation models may have higher token costs
#    - Preview models may have usage restrictions
# 
# 5. Image Generation Usage:
#    - Supports text-to-image, image editing, style transfer
#    - Can handle up to 3 input images
#    - Works best with detailed, descriptive prompts
# 
# =============================================================================